      "role": "user",
      "content": "i get that. it just feels weird to have all that money sitting in a random account. is there a risk of it being lost or something? i guess i'm just worried about the whole 'holding a hoard of cash' aspect of it, if that makes sense. it feels a bit risky just letting it sit there.",
